==Strategy==
Spamming cost-effective units like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is enough to beat this stage. Bringing a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cat]] like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]] is helpful against the Metal Hippoes, but isn't necessary.

